1. Running kubernetes
https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/tools/install-kubectl-macos/#install-kubectl-on-macos
https://formulae.brew.sh/formula/minikube

```
brew install kubectl
brew install minikube

minikube start --memory=4096
```

2. Running Kafka cluster in Kubernetes
https://medium.com/streamingdata/running-kafka-locally-inside-kubernetes-25e84586bbf3
https://strimzi.io/quickstarts/
```
kubectl create namespace kafka
kubectl create -f 'https://strimzi.io/install/latest?namespace=kafka' -n kafka

kubectl get pods -n kafka
kubectl get kafkas -n kafka
kubectl apply -f ./local-dev/kubernetes/kafka.yaml -n kafka
```

3. Kafka-UI
https://stackoverflow.com/questions/72727463/deploy-kafka-ui-in-kubernetes-got-502-bad-gateway
```
kubectl apply -f ./local-dev/kubernetes/kafka-ui-deployment.yaml -n kafka
kubectl apply -f ./local-dev/kubernetes/kafka-ui-service.yaml -n kafka
```

1. Nginx Ingress
https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/access-application-cluster/ingress-minikube/
```
minikube addons enable ingress

kubectl get pods -n ingress-nginx

kubectl apply -f ./local-dev/kubernetes/ingress.yaml -n kafka
```